Title:-
Data Visualization using Bivariate Distribution

Aim:-
Create a scatter plot with labelled axes and color.

Program (Scala):-
object Main extends App {

  val data = List(12, 15, 18, 20, 15, 18, 17, 22, 25, 18)

  // Create bin of width 5
  val histogram = data.groupBy(x => (x / 5) * 5)
    .map { case (bin, values) => (bin, values.size) }
    .toSeq
    .sortBy(_._1)

  println("Histogram")
  println("Range\tFrequency")

  histogram.foreach {
    case (bin, freq) =>
      println(s"$bin-${bin + 4}\t$freq")
  }
}

